      "title": "Here Be Dragons Theme",
      "description": "Parchment, ink and blood: the full shadcn variable set plus the HBD palette, status and spell-school colours, radii and offset shadows. Merged into your CSS file — nothing is overwritten wholesale. Light, .dark and .high-contrast. Ships no font files: it only sets the font-family variables, so add @hbd/fonts for our typefaces or point the variables at your own.",
